t"],[["下午經過來吃吃看\n16:00開放用機器點餐取號\n16:30開始營業叫號\n\n16:00點完餐我們就去附近逛逛\n大約16:25回來\n16:30店員會出來叫號\n依照順序排隊\n因為是第一組很快就進去了\n\n店內空間滿舒適的\n佈置溫馨，很多貓貓裝飾\n\n我們兩人點了\n「牛肝菌豚骨醬油拉麵$280」及\n「特級。牛肝菌豚骨醬油拉麵$360」\n可以加清湯跟免費加麵一次\n店員非常客氣有親和力\n\n我選擇硬的粗麵\n咬起來Q彈我喜歡\n下次點更硬試試看😋\n湯頭順口且濃郁\n溏心蛋非常優秀\n肉都滿好吃的\n\n驚艷的是免費加麵\n來的一碗麵上還有肉\n是不是太有誠意\n整頓吃下來滿足又飽足",null,[0,35]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/6280102188131553471/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhOZVZReE9VTldNRVV6WW5wc2RWZFZhekpqVXpGb1lqTk9URmRGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6280102188131553471/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhOZVZReE9VTldNRVV6WW5wc2RWZFZhekpqVXpGb1lqTk9URmRGUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/6280102188131553471/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhOZVZReE9VTldNRVV6WW5wc2RWZFZhekpqVXpGb1lqTk9URmRGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6280102188131553471/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhOZVZReE9VTldNRVV6WW5wc2RWZFZhekpqVXpGb1lqTk9URmRGUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/6280102188131553471/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhOZVZReE9VTldNRVV6WW5wc2RWZFZhekpqVXpGb1lqTk9URmRGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6280102188131553471/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhOZVZReE9VTldNRVV6WW5wc2RWZFZhekpqVXpGb1lqTk9URmRGUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,26761,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xNeVQxOUNWMEUzYnpsdVdVazJjUzFoYjNOTFdFRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xd27bfb438c30b04a!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlMyT19CV0E3bzluWUk2cS1hb3NLWEE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xNeVQxOUNWMEUzYnpsdVdVazJjUzFoYjNOTFdFRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xNeVQxOUNWMEUzYnpsdVdVazJjUzFoYjNOTFdFRRI-Ci9D